{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"agent_message","text":"The defect is in the core deletion service: it deleted products when their category set became empty, and the facade used a lazy entity lookup that could turn a missing ID into a server error. I’ve changed deletion to remove only product-category links and to validate the category against the current store before deleting."}}
